Please list the main differences, including the efficiency, between the Las Vegas and Monte Carlo algorithms. (2)

Source: [[Tema Esame 2025-07-04-1st.pdf#page=3|2025-07-04-1st · Exercise 2B · p. 3]]

^aapp-05-005

