 unsigned int seed = 0;
#pragma omp for firstprivate(seed) reduction(+:pi) {
for(int i = 0; i < 100; ++i) {
    const float x = (rand_r(&seed)) / (float) RAND_MAX;
    const float y = (rand_r(&seed)) / (float) RAND_MAX;
    if (x*x + y*y) pi += 1;
}}
pi = 4 * pi / 100;
```

Source: [[Tema Esame 2026-1-22-2nd.pdf#page=4|2026-1-22-2nd · Exercise 3C · p. 4]]

